         <div class="title margin-bottom-100">
            <h1 class="feature-title h2">Property Management Services in North Vancouver</h1>
         </div>
         <div class="row">
            <div class="panel-group detail">
               <p class="col-12 col-md-6">
                  We specialize in managing residential properties in North Vancouver and Lower Mainland. We work
with home owners to find quality tenants and take care of your property.
                  <br><br>
                  The economy is strong and more and more people are choosing to make North Vancouver their home. In
                  recent years, residential development in North Vancouver neighbourhoods such as Lynn Valley, Lonsdale,
                  and near Lionsgate Hospital have created new opportunities to turn real estate investment into cash
                  flow. Still, for many investors, the thought of managing residential properties can be a real turn
                  off. So, what’s the solution? It’s simple: work with a qualified and professional property manager.
                  <br><br>
                  Property management is likely exactly what you would expect it to be – professionals with expertise in
                  caring for all aspects of a rental property manage your residential real estate investment so that you
                  don’t have to.
                  <br><br>
                  <b>Vancouver Luxury Rentals (VLR) is the ideal property management firm if you want to take the
                     hassle
                     out of owning a rental property in North Vancouver. </b>VLR property management services run the
                  gamut
                  and
                  include:


               </p>
               <p class="col-12 col-md-6 center">
                  <iframe
                     src=https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d20806.878794545763!2d-123.07038505!3d49.316937749999994!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x54867046f9232b41%3A0x6f85cb4bd4fbec5a!2sNorth+Vancouver%2C+BC!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sca!4v1421790953257"
                     width="400" height="300" frameborder="0" style="border:0; max-width:95%" allowfullscreen></iframe>
               </p>

               <div style="    clear: both;">
                  <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
                     <ul>
                        <li>Showing properties</li>
                        <li>Tenant screening and selection</li>
                        <li>Rent collection</li>

                     </ul>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
                     <ul>

                        <li>Maintenance and inspections</li>
                        <li>Lease administration</li>
                        <li>Conflict resolution</li>

                     </ul>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
                     <ul>

                        <li>Property inspections</li>
                        <li>Financial reporting</li>
                        <li>Asset management and protection</li>
                     </ul>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <div class="col-12 col-md-12">
                  <p>In a nutshell, VLR offers all the services you need to ensure your property is well-maintained, but
                     also to ensure you get the best possible return on your investment.</p>
               </div>
               <div class="col-12 col-md-12">
                  <h2>Why Choose Vancouver Luxury Rentals (VLR)?</h2>
                  <p>There are many property management firms serving the Greater Vancouver region, but few compare with
                     the quality of service provided by VLR. We not only offer a comprehensive array of property
                     management services, but we bring unparalleled values and integrity to our business operations. We
                     adhere to the highest ethical standards and maintain clear procedural guidelines so we can provide
                     consistent, quality services across all the properties we manage. We even have exceptional
                     marketing expertise that helps us keep our vacancy rates as low as possible. Most importantly, we
                     are dedicated to building strong relationships not only with property owners but also tenants –
                     ultimately, happy tenants are stable tenants that allow our clients to maximize their investment
                     property revenue.</p>
                  <p>At VLR we utilize more than 15 years of property management services and expertise to manage more
                     than 300 investment properties. Our experience in rental investment property management allows us
                     to build and maintain excellent relationships with tenants and property owners. We endeavour to
                     work closely with each of our clients to identify and provide flexible services that meet your
                     unique needs. Whether you are investing in Lower Lonsdale, Cedardale, or anywhere in North
                     Vancouver, our elite team of Luxury Rental Specialists work tirelessly so your investment property
                     is lucrative and headache free.</p>
                  <p>If you’re ready to let professionals manage your rental property, contact VLR today and discover
                     the difference of professional property management the VLR way!</p>
               </div>
            </div>
